WEBVTT

00:16.680 --> 00:20.280
Your eyes that look far off
into the distance

00:20.280 --> 00:23.950
They're listening to the voice
within your heart

00:23.950 --> 00:28.120
Embracing a moon still blue

00:31.160 --> 00:34.830
Your strength to keep on running

00:34.830 --> 00:38.470
Will open another new door for you

00:38.470 --> 00:42.670
Illuminate the night that
dawns too soon

00:45.670 --> 00:53.050
Even alone, I want to keep on
believing in you

00:53.050 --> 01:00.290
It's in such a moment that
this world will begin to stir

01:00.290 --> 01:03.930
What should we be searching for?

01:03.930 --> 01:07.560
Send out your soul

01:07.560 --> 01:14.330
We'll meet here again someday
if that's the truth

01:14.700 --> 01:18.410
Upon what should we fix our gaze?

01:18.410 --> 01:25.210
The reality that I reached out
and grabbed with my hand

01:25.210 --> 01:28.880
Let it go, let's believe in it

01:36.790 --> 01:40.660
In a nebulous era when the Heavens
and Earth intermingled,

01:40.900 --> 01:45.770
there was a peaceful land where
man and demon coexisted,

01:47.100 --> 01:51.540
the origin of civilization
and faith, Shangri-La.

01:52.010 --> 01:54.100
However, at this very moment,

01:55.180 --> 01:58.640
there is a negative aura
sweeping the world

01:58.980 --> 02:01.950
and the demons have begun
to go berserk.

02:09.620 --> 02:13.490
In India, far to the west of Shangri-La,

02:14.030 --> 02:17.470
there is one who commands
those demons.

02:30.650 --> 02:33.320
There, now! Come on down!

02:33.320 --> 02:36.770
Those fruits are not meant for lowly
beings such as yourself!

02:37.250 --> 02:38.880
Aw, shuddup!

02:39.250 --> 02:42.590
What's it matter? There's a lot here.
What's one or two?

02:46.460 --> 02:48.950
What's all this commotion about?

02:49.360 --> 02:51.830
Master Sanzo, please do
something about this.

02:51.830 --> 02:53.160
Your companion is...

02:53.470 --> 02:57.540
He is eating the peaches that are
offerings to the Merciful Goddess!

02:57.540 --> 02:59.600
But they're just like any other peaches.

03:00.380 --> 03:04.310
My companion?! It's not like
I have a choice!

03:04.650 --> 03:06.280
But...

03:06.280 --> 03:07.340
Hey, Goku!

03:08.980 --> 03:10.540
If you're done eating, let's go!

03:10.950 --> 03:12.250
Go where?

03:13.390 --> 03:18.190
Hey, hey, where are you taking me?
A restaurant?

03:18.190 --> 03:19.900
You stupid monkey!

03:19.900 --> 03:22.000
Ow! What the hell was that for?!

03:22.000 --> 03:24.470
What do you think?!
Hurry up and go change!

03:24.730 --> 03:26.860
Quit grumbling or I'm
leaving you behind!

03:27.570 --> 03:29.060
Oh, fine.

03:29.470 --> 03:32.210
Such constant trouble...

03:32.210 --> 03:38.410
Why did a great man like Master
Sanzo pick up such a hooligan?

03:38.410 --> 03:40.110
I cannot agree more.

03:42.280 --> 03:45.410
If you're going to gossip,
do it out of earshot.

03:46.190 --> 03:48.990
What I pick up or throw away
is none of your business.

03:49.460 --> 03:51.830
Sanzo, did you pick something up?

03:51.830 --> 03:54.160
Shut up! You want to die?

03:56.400 --> 03:59.200
Why did I pick him up?

03:59.200 --> 04:01.260
That's what I'd like to know.

04:03.470 --> 04:07.030
Hey, are you the one that's been
calling to me all this time?

04:08.640 --> 04:11.910
I haven't been calling anyone.

04:11.910 --> 04:13.570
Who are you?

04:14.080 --> 04:17.520
That's a lie. I've been hearing you
the whole time.

04:18.090 --> 04:21.420
It's annoying, so cut it out.

04:23.560 --> 04:24.580
Come on.

04:24.960 --> 04:27.990
I'll take you with me, since it looks
like I've got no choice.

04:30.830 --> 04:31.960
Wait up!

04:34.440 --> 04:38.270
Hey, Sanzo, where are we going?

04:38.270 --> 04:39.740
Hey? Hey, hey?

04:40.280 --> 04:42.280
Hey, Sanzo, hello?!

04:42.280 --> 04:44.980
Make any more noise and I'll kill you!

04:44.980 --> 04:48.040
You could at least tell me
where we're going!

04:49.180 --> 04:51.450
We're going to see Hakkai and Gojyo.

04:52.350 --> 04:53.820
And after that...

04:54.920 --> 04:56.220
After that?

05:23.850 --> 05:25.650
Good luck, Gojyo!

05:25.650 --> 05:26.920
Win again!

05:27.460 --> 05:28.920
Not so fast.

05:29.390 --> 05:33.050
I've got two pairs, kings over jacks.

05:35.060 --> 05:38.500
What a coincidence,
I've got two pairs too.

05:39.470 --> 05:43.160
A pair of queens and
a pair of queens.

05:43.410 --> 05:46.340
Oops, that's called four
of a kind, isn't it?

05:47.310 --> 05:48.210
That's our Gojyo!

05:48.210 --> 05:48.310
You're so wonderful!
That's our Gojyo!

05:48.310 --> 05:49.010
You're so wonderful!

05:49.010 --> 05:51.280
Damn it! Just take it all!

05:51.280 --> 05:52.440
Goddamn!

05:54.080 --> 05:56.150
Sorry about that, Soushi.

05:56.150 --> 05:58.690
I've got uncommonly good
luck with the ladies,

05:58.690 --> 06:00.750
so the queens tend to gather
in my hand.

06:09.660 --> 06:10.720
Hey, quit it!

06:13.770 --> 06:17.260
He's totally lost it. What the hell's
going on here?

06:22.610 --> 06:24.510
I told you to quit it!

06:35.390 --> 06:36.860
You still gonna keep at it?

06:37.390 --> 06:39.220
I'm not going easy on you this time.

06:41.660 --> 06:44.890
I see. Guess I've got no choice.

06:54.510 --> 06:58.810
Man, and he was a good mark too.

07:10.660 --> 07:12.560
What a terrible fog.

07:13.330 --> 07:15.060
Hakuryu, fog lamps.

07:19.970 --> 07:21.030
Whoops!

07:23.740 --> 07:25.830
We can't stop in time!
Hakuryu, turn back!

07:32.180 --> 07:33.650
Are you all right?

07:35.250 --> 07:36.720
You are...

07:42.460 --> 07:43.860
What's the matter?

07:44.290 --> 07:47.090
Have you become separated
from your parents?

07:50.570 --> 07:53.900
I am Hakkai. You are?

07:57.110 --> 08:01.100
Oh? Are you hurt somewhere?
Are you all right?

08:09.520 --> 08:11.420
There is nothing to fear.

08:12.150 --> 08:14.420
I am the same as you.

08:15.660 --> 08:18.490
Well, perhaps not quite...

08:18.490 --> 08:20.930
But we're roughly the same.

08:23.870 --> 08:26.490
Now, it's late already, so go on home.

08:33.610 --> 08:35.010
This is...

08:35.440 --> 08:38.900
It seems he has lost himself.

08:39.850 --> 08:40.870
Hakuryu!

08:58.130 --> 09:01.940
Is there no school today, I wonder?

09:01.940 --> 09:05.240
But unfortunately, big brother
here is in a hurry,

09:05.540 --> 09:07.870
so I won't be able to play with you.

09:13.580 --> 09:15.340
I smell something sinister.

09:15.850 --> 09:18.080
I suppose this is what you would
call the root of all evil.

09:19.050 --> 09:21.420
I sense trouble ahead of us.

09:21.990 --> 09:23.860
What shall we do, Hakuryu?

09:38.570 --> 09:41.080
Man, I'm hungry!

09:41.080 --> 09:43.650
Hey, Sanzo, aren't we there yet?

09:43.650 --> 09:45.810
I'm so hungry that I can't
walk anymore!

09:47.650 --> 09:49.280
Hey!

09:49.280 --> 09:50.880
Shut the hell up!

09:51.950 --> 09:54.720
We're almost there! Walk,
you stupid monkey!

09:54.720 --> 09:57.620
Don't wanna! I can't walk
another step!

09:58.160 --> 10:00.600
I'm gonna starve to death!

10:00.600 --> 10:04.530
Damn it, you won't die
even if you're killed.

10:04.530 --> 10:06.900
I need recharging.

10:06.900 --> 10:08.000
That's nothing to be proud of.

10:08.000 --> 10:12.440
We could've just got Hakkai to come
pick us up with Hakuryu!

10:12.440 --> 10:15.140
Shut up! Now hurry up and walk!

10:15.140 --> 10:18.840
Besides, why are we suddenly going
to see Gojyo and Hakkai?

10:20.420 --> 10:22.510
Hey, come on, Sanzo!

10:24.120 --> 10:26.140
There's something I want to confirm.

10:26.850 --> 10:28.820
Something you want to confirm?

10:30.220 --> 10:32.660
Yesterday, I was summoned
by the Sanbutsushin

10:32.660 --> 10:35.030
at the Temple of the Setting Sun
in Chang'an.

10:38.700 --> 10:41.000
Servant of the Northern
God of Heaven,

10:41.000 --> 10:43.160
Genjo Sanzo, humbly presents himself.

10:51.310 --> 10:54.180
You have done well to come,
Genjo Sanzo.

10:54.750 --> 10:55.880
My Lords...

10:56.620 --> 10:59.990
Time is of the essence. You must
pardon us for pressing you.

10:59.990 --> 11:01.050
Not at all.

11:02.720 --> 11:04.450
You are surely already aware

11:04.890 --> 11:07.950
of the disturbance that is
eating away at this world.

11:09.730 --> 11:11.900
From west to east,

11:11.900 --> 11:15.870
the affliction now spans
the whole of Shangri-La.

11:15.870 --> 11:19.240
The sudden tendency towards
savagery of all demons

11:19.240 --> 11:21.370
and their loss of self.

11:21.880 --> 11:23.070
Indeed.

11:24.350 --> 11:27.450
Humans now cower before demons,

11:27.450 --> 11:30.820
living their days in terror,
next to death.

11:31.390 --> 11:35.290
Shangri-La is now only a name.
It is the very picture of Hell.

11:35.660 --> 11:38.890
What in the world is the cause
of all this?

11:38.890 --> 11:41.760
Do you know of Gyumaoh?

11:44.030 --> 11:45.120
Gyumaoh!

11:54.010 --> 11:56.570
Do you know of Gyumaoh?

11:57.040 --> 11:58.380
Gyumaoh...

11:59.280 --> 12:01.880
Do you refer to the great
demon that refused

12:01.880 --> 12:07.150
to coexist with humans and devoured
humans as it pleased him?

12:07.660 --> 12:08.880
The same.

12:09.590 --> 12:13.150
But I had heard that Gyumaoh
was laid low in Houtou Castle

12:13.530 --> 12:16.030
by the war god, Crown Prince Nataku,

12:16.030 --> 12:20.800
in the land of India far west of here,
a distant 500 years ago.

12:21.500 --> 12:26.910
Now, Gyumaoh is on the verge
of being revived by someone.

12:27.940 --> 12:31.080
Not only that, it is by means of
the forbidden and tainted art...

12:31.080 --> 12:34.050
...of combining science
and black magic.

12:34.420 --> 12:35.750
Forbidden?

12:36.550 --> 12:37.850
Why?

12:39.050 --> 12:41.520
Because no one knows
what may happen.

12:45.660 --> 12:49.390
Science and black magic are
incompatible from the start.

12:50.260 --> 12:54.030
Just as joining with humans is taboo.

12:55.040 --> 12:56.830
It will produce a negative aura

12:57.170 --> 12:59.870
that will destroy the balance in things.

12:59.870 --> 13:04.740
You are saying that is the cause
of the demons' savagery?

13:05.510 --> 13:07.170
We fear it is so.

13:10.650 --> 13:13.950
Genjo Sanzo, I command you!

13:14.790 --> 13:20.230
Take Goku, Gojyo, and Hakkai,
whom you share a past with,

13:20.730 --> 13:25.100
and head for India in the far west,
to the root of all this evil!

13:25.830 --> 13:28.540
Discover who is conducting

13:28.540 --> 13:32.670
the experiments to revive
Gyumaoh and why.

13:33.010 --> 13:35.810
And put a stop to
Gyumaoh's resurrection!

13:35.810 --> 13:38.950
In order to recall the demons
to themselves.

13:38.950 --> 13:43.380
In order to regain Shangri-La, the land
of peace and tranquility.

13:44.420 --> 13:45.510
As you wish.

13:47.150 --> 13:50.090
So, in other words,

13:50.460 --> 13:54.960
we just gotta go to this India place

13:54.960 --> 13:57.600
and make them stop the
Gyumaoh experiments, right?

13:57.600 --> 13:58.900
That's a piece of cake!

14:00.130 --> 14:01.940
You know...

14:01.940 --> 14:04.210
Piece of cake! Piece of cake!

14:04.210 --> 14:06.440
In that case, let's hurry up
and get going.

14:06.440 --> 14:08.110
Look here...

14:08.110 --> 14:11.340
So what did you want to confirm
with Gojyo and Hakkai?

14:11.750 --> 14:12.910
That was...

14:15.180 --> 14:16.420
Die!

14:16.420 --> 14:17.980
Nyoi-bou!

14:30.160 --> 14:31.320
You're slow.

14:33.670 --> 14:34.830
Freeze!

14:37.000 --> 14:43.200
Idiot! You think you can kill
a demon with just a gun?

14:43.580 --> 14:45.050
You're the idiot.

14:45.610 --> 14:47.840
This isn't just any gun.

14:49.380 --> 14:51.820
It's a banishing gun for killing demons.

14:53.420 --> 14:54.660
Die!

14:54.660 --> 14:55.750
Wait!

15:02.830 --> 15:07.300
Go train again in the world beyond.

15:07.300 --> 15:08.290
Sanzo!

15:11.940 --> 15:14.240
Don't tell me these guys are all...

15:14.240 --> 15:17.310
Demons who have switched
sides to Gyumaoh.

15:17.310 --> 15:18.610
It's a human.

15:18.610 --> 15:19.510
Eat him!

15:19.510 --> 15:19.650
Let's eat him!
Eat him!

15:19.650 --> 15:20.980
Let's eat him!

15:21.920 --> 15:23.320
We let our guards down.

15:23.320 --> 15:25.380
They look totally crazed!

15:32.430 --> 15:34.390
I'm finally beginning to see

15:34.830 --> 15:41.030
what's happening to this world,
and why it's gotta be us.

15:43.840 --> 15:46.210
Gojyo! Hakkai!

15:46.210 --> 15:48.070
Long time no see.

15:52.010 --> 15:55.120
How've you been, you stinking monk
and stupid monkey?

15:55.120 --> 15:57.710
Don't call me a stupid monkey,
you pervy water sprite!

15:57.950 --> 16:00.420
Then are you a dumb monkey?! Well?!

16:00.420 --> 16:02.020
I ain't a dumb monkey either!

16:02.020 --> 16:02.820
Then are you mini?! How
about tiny?! Or micro?!

16:02.820 --> 16:03.320
Now, now.
Then are you mini?! How
about tiny?! Or micro?!

16:03.320 --> 16:03.860
No! Why, you! Just shut up!
Now, now.
Then are you mini?! How
about tiny?! Or micro?!

16:03.860 --> 16:04.730
No! Why, you! Just shut up!
Then are you mini?! How
about tiny?! Or micro?!

16:04.730 --> 16:05.890
No! Why, you! Just shut up!
How did you find us?
Then are you mini?! How
about tiny?! Or micro?!

16:05.890 --> 16:06.290
No! Why, you! Just shut up!
How did you find us?

16:06.290 --> 16:06.660
How did you find us?

16:06.660 --> 16:10.600
I sensed an enormous amount of
malignant, demonic aura, so...

16:12.200 --> 16:16.870
It seems that the only demons
in Shangri-La

16:16.870 --> 16:20.270
that have retained their sense of self
are Gojyo, Goku, and myself.

16:20.680 --> 16:22.070
Surprise attack!

16:30.280 --> 16:33.790
Moron! Maybe in two hundred
million years.

16:33.790 --> 16:35.990
Oh, but I guess he can't hear me now.

16:35.990 --> 16:37.060
Let's get him!

16:37.060 --> 16:38.660
Hakuryu, it's dangerous here, so...
We'll start with the weakest-
looking one!

16:38.660 --> 16:39.590
Hakuryu, it's dangerous here, so...
It's a little cheap, but it's a sure thing!

16:39.590 --> 16:40.460
It's a little cheap, but it's a sure thing!

16:52.510 --> 16:55.680
Hakkai, when did you learn
that technique?

16:55.680 --> 16:57.940
I just tried it for the first time.

16:58.510 --> 17:00.570
I copied something I saw once.

17:00.980 --> 17:03.450
Well, I guess copying
works pretty well.

17:04.120 --> 17:06.090
It usually wouldn't.

17:06.450 --> 17:09.420
Look at those cuffs and gold band!

17:11.230 --> 17:13.250
Demon power limiters!

17:13.630 --> 17:15.690
You three are demons, aren't you?!

17:16.830 --> 17:18.270
Shut up.

17:18.270 --> 17:20.840
Why do you fight against us?!

17:20.840 --> 17:22.200
Want us to tell you?

17:23.300 --> 17:24.830
If you survive!

17:31.780 --> 17:35.940
My Lords Sanbutsushin, I have
one question I wish to ask.

17:37.850 --> 17:42.150
Why have you appointed those three,
who are demons?

17:42.490 --> 17:47.430
They are certainly demons,
but they are also human.

17:47.430 --> 17:50.000
That is why they can maintain
their sense of self

17:50.000 --> 17:52.060
without giving in to the negative aura.

17:52.870 --> 17:58.810
Genjo Sanzo, that is something you
know well, having seen it all.

17:59.310 --> 18:03.170
It is ironic that the scars each of them
bears from their pasts

18:03.540 --> 18:07.280
are what form the web that
connects you all.

18:10.990 --> 18:13.820
Power and spiritual strength
that makes them equal

18:13.820 --> 18:15.880
to the task of defeating other demons.

18:16.760 --> 18:20.350
They are the final trump cards
that have been left to us.

18:22.630 --> 18:25.620
Yes, I cannot deny their abilities.

18:26.370 --> 18:30.200
However, as long as demonic blood
flows in their veins,

18:30.200 --> 18:33.070
we never know when that blood
may gain supremacy,

18:33.070 --> 18:35.200
causing them to turn on us.

18:36.010 --> 18:40.240
I believe putting our faith in such
a lot would be suicidal.

18:40.820 --> 18:43.050
Whether you really believe that
or you are just saying that,

18:43.420 --> 18:45.650
it does not change the fact
that it is true.

18:45.650 --> 18:48.260
Genjo Sanzo, in truth,

18:48.260 --> 18:52.960
the one who appointed those three
demons as your companions

18:52.960 --> 18:56.290
was the Merciful Goddess
of the Heavens.

18:57.060 --> 18:59.120
The Merciful Goddess?!

19:04.170 --> 19:05.940
With all due respect,

19:05.940 --> 19:09.470
the only one I can trust
in this world is myself.

19:11.050 --> 19:13.950
Ever since I lost what was
dearest to me,

19:14.650 --> 19:16.980
my feelings on that have
never changed.

19:17.720 --> 19:22.590
Then Sanzo, trust in what you see
with the eye of your heart.

19:22.590 --> 19:24.460
The eye of my heart?

19:25.130 --> 19:29.320
Go meet them and make
certain with that eye

19:29.660 --> 19:35.190
what it is that you need to and
ought to believe in right now.

19:36.140 --> 19:37.730
Awesome, awesome!

19:38.710 --> 19:41.230
What I ought to believe in...

19:42.180 --> 19:43.910
Wait...

19:44.480 --> 19:46.680
Traitors who would take the side

19:46.680 --> 19:49.250
of powerless and arrogant humans!

19:49.250 --> 19:52.220
That is not where you belong!

19:52.220 --> 19:57.060
Think it over! Raise your
voices with ours!

19:57.060 --> 19:59.490
Long live the demon kingdom!

19:59.490 --> 20:01.190
Idiot!

20:07.800 --> 20:10.370
That sure was some stupid nonsense.

20:10.370 --> 20:12.070
Taking sides with humans?

20:12.810 --> 20:14.870
Ever since I was born and until I die,

20:15.540 --> 20:17.910
I'll always be on MY side
and my side alone!

20:18.710 --> 20:21.010
Believe in your own eye...

20:22.250 --> 20:23.340
Goku?

20:25.020 --> 20:26.280
Gojyo?

20:26.650 --> 20:27.620
Yeah?

20:28.320 --> 20:29.720
Hakkai?

20:29.720 --> 20:30.920
Yes...

20:31.660 --> 20:33.630
Let's go! To the west!

20:43.600 --> 20:49.670
That's right, even sudden
tragedies come

20:50.040 --> 20:55.180
Looking good-natured, without
cause for suspicion

20:55.620 --> 21:00.850
Don't complain, just shut up

21:00.850 --> 21:04.160
And look up

21:04.160 --> 21:10.160
I'll stay in character no matter
how ordinary the scene is

21:10.160 --> 21:15.540
Before any talk of dreams or hopes

21:15.540 --> 21:20.980
It's probably the same for everyone

21:20.980 --> 21:24.930
You must fight against yourself

21:31.850 --> 21:35.490
The sun sets and a new day comes

21:35.490 --> 21:37.690
Repeating is one change

21:37.690 --> 21:41.730
Don't avert eyes from differences

21:41.730 --> 21:45.670
Your nerve and soul to the limit

21:45.670 --> 21:48.500
Go forward now

21:48.500 --> 21:53.470
Standing next to the taut pressure

21:53.470 --> 21:58.910
I'll laugh more boldly and
fearlessly than anyone

21:58.910 --> 22:04.390
It's probably the same for everyone

22:04.390 --> 22:08.450
You must fight against yourself

22:18.070 --> 22:19.500
Next Saiyuki

22:20.700 --> 22:22.770
A couple of days into our journey
after leaving Shangri-La,

22:22.770 --> 22:26.470
an enemy assassin has finally
been sent against us.

22:26.840 --> 22:28.610
A ferocious spider woman

22:28.610 --> 22:31.240
who would even kill her allies
if it serves her needs.

22:31.710 --> 22:34.510
Eww! Doesn't look tasty!

22:34.950 --> 22:38.110
But oh well, it'll be perfect exercise
to work off dinner.

22:38.350 --> 22:38.650
Next Time
A Guide to the Nether World

22:38.650 --> 22:41.320
Next Time
A Guide to the Nether World
Next time: "A Guide to the
Nether World"

22:41.320 --> 22:42.360
Next Time
A Guide to the Nether World
You'd do well to watch!

22:42.360 --> 22:42.620
You'd do well to watch!
